# Copy this file to .env and fill in your own key — .env is gitignored.
#
# Google Maps JavaScript API key, used only for the web build (react-native-maps
# has no web support, so the Map tab uses @react-google-maps/api on web instead).
# Must be prefixed with EXPO_PUBLIC_ so Expo exposes it to the client bundle.
# Restrict this key to your GitHub Pages domain (HTTP referrer restriction) in the
# Google Cloud Console — it will otherwise be visible in the deployed web bundle,
# which is normal for browser Maps API keys but should still be domain-locked.
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
